# 🚀 DevOps Transformation Plan — URL Shortener

## 1. Phân tích kiến trúc hiện tại

### Tech Stack
| Component | Technology |
|-----------|-----------|
| Framework | Spring Boot 4.0.6 / Java 21 |
| Database | PostgreSQL (6 schemas: `iam`, `link`, `analytics`, `platform`, `billing`, `public`) |
| Cache | Redis |
| Message Queue | Apache Kafka (click-events, audit-events) |
| Auth | JWT (HMAC-SHA256) + Spring Security OAuth2 Resource Server |
| Migration | Flyway (6 versions) |
| Build | Maven |

### Bounded Contexts đã có (trong monolith)

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Monolith — url-shortener"
        IAM["IAM<br/>Users, Roles, Permissions<br/>Auth, JWT, API Keys"]
        LINK["Link<br/>URLs, Domains, Tags<br/>Redirect, Rules"]
        ANALYTICS["Analytics<br/>Click Events, Aggregations<br/>Counters, Partitioned Tables"]
        PLATFORM["Platform<br/>Audit Logs, Outbox<br/>Idempotency, Blocked Domains"]
        BILLING["Billing<br/>Subscriptions, VNPay<br/>Payment Transactions"]
        COMMON["Common<br/>Security, Config, Exceptions<br/>Utils"]
    end

    LINK -->|"uses"| IAM
    LINK -->|"publishes events"| ANALYTICS
    ANALYTICS -->|"reads"| LINK
    BILLING -->|"checks quota"| LINK
    PLATFORM -->|"logs"| IAM
    LINK -->|"Kafka"| ANALYTICS
    PLATFORM -->|"Kafka"| PLATFORM
```

### Dependencies giữa các module

| From → To | Coupling Type | Details |
|-----------|--------------|---------|
| Link → IAM | DB FK | `links.owner_id → users.id` |
| Link → Analytics | Kafka | `ClickEventProducer.send()` |
| Analytics → Link | DB Read | `LinkRepository` (query linkId) |
| Billing → IAM | DB FK | `subscriptions.user_id → users.id` |
| Platform → IAM | DB FK | `audit_logs.actor_id → users.id` |
| All → Common | Code | Shared security, config, exceptions |

---

## 2. Phương án tách Microservices

### 2.1 Chiến lược: Strangler Fig Pattern

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Không tách hết ngay. Giữ monolith chạy ổn, tách dần từng service ra.

### 2.2 Target Architecture — 5 Services

```mermaid
graph TB
    CLIENT["Client / Frontend"]
    GATEWAY["API Gateway<br/>(Spring Cloud Gateway)"]
    
    CLIENT --> GATEWAY
    
    GATEWAY --> AUTH_SVC["auth-service<br/>IAM + JWT"]
    GATEWAY --> LINK_SVC["link-service<br/>URL CRUD + Redirect"]
    GATEWAY --> ANALYTICS_SVC["analytics-service<br/>Click tracking + Dashboard"]
    GATEWAY --> BILLING_SVC["billing-service<br/>Subscription + VNPay"]
    GATEWAY --> PLATFORM_SVC["platform-service<br/>Audit + Admin"]
    
    KAFKA["Apache Kafka"]
    LINK_SVC -->|"click-events"| KAFKA
    PLATFORM_SVC -->|"audit-events"| KAFKA
    KAFKA --> ANALYTICS_SVC
    KAFKA --> PLATFORM_SVC
    
    AUTH_DB[(auth-db<br/>PostgreSQL)]
    LINK_DB[(link-db<br/>PostgreSQL)]
    ANALYTICS_DB[(analytics-db<br/>PostgreSQL)]
    BILLING_DB[(billing-db<br/>PostgreSQL)]
    PLATFORM_DB[(platform-db<br/>PostgreSQL)]
    
    AUTH_SVC --> AUTH_DB
    LINK_SVC --> LINK_DB
    ANALYTICS_SVC --> ANALYTICS_DB
    BILLING_SVC --> BILLING_DB
    PLATFORM_SVC --> PLATFORM_DB
    
    REDIS["Redis Cluster"]
    AUTH_SVC --> REDIS
    LINK_SVC --> REDIS
```

### 2.3 Chi tiết từng Service

#### 🔐 auth-service
- **Schemas**: `iam.*` (users, roles, permissions, refresh_tokens, api_keys, token_blacklist)
- **APIs**: `/api/v1/auth/**`, `/api/v1/users/**`
- **Giao tiếp**: Cung cấp JWT public key cho các service khác validate token locally

#### 🔗 link-service
- **Schemas**: `link.*` (links, domains, tags, redirect_lookup, link_rules)
- **APIs**: `/api/v1/links/**`, `/api/v1/domains/**`, `/api/v1/tags/**`, `/r/{shortCode}`
- **Giao tiếp**: Publish `click-events` → Kafka; gọi `billing-service` qua REST để check quota

#### 📊 analytics-service
- **Schemas**: `analytics.*` (click_events, click_agg_minute, click_agg_daily, link_counters)
- **APIs**: `/api/v1/analytics/**`
- **Giao tiếp**: Consume `click-events` từ Kafka; batch insert DB

#### 💳 billing-service
- **Schemas**: `billing.*` (subscriptions, payment_transactions)
- **APIs**: `/api/v1/billing/**`
- **Giao tiếp**: REST endpoint `/internal/quota/check` cho link-service gọi

#### 🛡️ platform-service
- **Schemas**: `platform.*` (audit_logs, outbox_events, idempotency_keys, blocked_domains)
- **APIs**: `/api/v1/admin/**`
- **Giao tiếp**: Consume `audit-events` từ Kafka

### 2.4 Database Strategy

| Strategy | Áp dụng |
|----------|---------|
| Database-per-service | Mỗi service 1 PostgreSQL instance (hoặc 1 DB riêng trong cùng cluster) |
| Shared-nothing | Xóa FK cross-schema, thay bằng eventual consistency |
| Event Sourcing | Click events đã dùng Kafka → giữ nguyên |
| Saga Pattern | Billing ↔ Link quota: Choreography saga qua Kafka |

### 2.5 Xử lý Cross-Service FK

```
# TRƯỚC (monolith): Direct FK
links.owner_id → iam.users(id)

# SAU (microservices): Store userId as opaque UUID
# link-service lưu owner_id nhưng KHÔNG có FK constraint
# Validate user existence qua JWT claims (đã có trong token)
```

