## 6. Observability Stack

### 6.1 Tổng quan

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Application"
        APP["url-shortener<br/>(Spring Boot)"]
        MICROMETER["Micrometer<br/>+ OTLP Exporter"]
    end

    subgraph "Metrics"
        PROM["Prometheus"]
        GRAFANA["Grafana"]
    end

    subgraph "Logging"
        LOKI["Grafana Loki"]
        PROMTAIL["Promtail"]
    end

    subgraph "Tracing"
        JAEGER["Jaeger"]
    end

    APP --> MICROMETER
    MICROMETER -->|"/actuator/prometheus"| PROM
    MICROMETER -->|"OTLP traces"| JAEGER
    APP -->|"stdout JSON"| PROMTAIL
    PROMTAIL --> LOKI
    PROM --> GRAFANA
    LOKI --> GRAFANA
    JAEGER --> GRAFANA
```

### 6.2 Dependencies cần thêm vào pom.xml

```xml
<!-- Metrics: Prometheus endpoint -->
<dependency>
    <groupId>io.micrometer</groupId>
    <artifactId>micrometer-registry-prometheus</artifactId>
</dependency>

<!-- Tracing: OpenTelemetry auto-instrumentation -->
<dependency>
    <groupId>io.micrometer</groupId>
    <artifactId>micrometer-tracing-bridge-otel</artifactId>
</dependency>
<dependency>
    <groupId>io.opentelemetry</groupId>
    <artifactId>opentelemetry-exporter-otlp</artifactId>
</dependency>

<!-- Structured JSON logging -->
<dependency>
    <groupId>ch.qos.logback.contrib</groupId>
    <artifactId>logback-json-classic</artifactId>
</dependency>
```

### 6.3 Application Config bổ sung

```yaml
# application-production.yaml
management:
  endpoints:
    web:
      exposure:
        include: health,info,prometheus,metrics
  metrics:
    tags:
      application: url-shortener
    distribution:
      percentiles-histogram:
        http.server.requests: true
  tracing:
    sampling:
      probability: 1.0  # 100% cho dev, 0.1 cho production
  otlp:
    tracing:
      endpoint: http://jaeger:4318/v1/traces
```

### 6.4 Key Grafana Dashboards

| Dashboard | Metrics |
|-----------|---------|
| **JVM Overview** | Heap usage, GC pauses, thread count |
| **HTTP Requests** | Request rate, latency p50/p95/p99, error rate |
| **Kafka Consumer** | Consumer lag, batch processing time, records/sec |
| **Database** | HikariCP pool size, connection wait time, query time |
| **Business Metrics** | Links created/day, redirects/sec, active users |

